<DIV CLASS="title2">Searching for and selecting contracts</DIV>

<BLOCKQUOTE>



<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="6" bordercolorlight="#FFFFFF" bordercolordark="#FFFFFF" bordercolor="#FFFFFF">
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>searching
      for &quot;all&quot;:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="left" style="margin-bottom: 4">By
      leaving all of the search criteria on the default settings and clicking
      &quot;Search&quot;, you will receive all of the listings in our data
      base.&nbsp; A note of caution -- the data base is very large and the
      number of records you will be receive may span several pages of
      results.&nbsp; It is best to search against one or more of the criteria
      provided.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Using
      search strings:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">The
      empty boxes to the left of several of the search criteria are used for
      searching based on a string of characters.&nbsp; The search is not case
      sensitive and will return any result that contains your string.&nbsp; For
      example, if you were searching for Donald's BBQ House and entered &quot;Donald's&quot;
      in the box, you would receive all of the McDonald's records as
      well.
      <p>When searching for Contracts, search
      strings can be used against the contract number, title, and the names of
      the <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.operator_label_singular#</cfoutput>, <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_singular#</cfoutput>, and broker associated with it.&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>drop-down
      boxes:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">Some
      of the search criteria is provided via a drop-down box, allowing you to
      pick one of the description criteria provided.&nbsp; You can make
      selections in more than one of the drop downs, and combine those with
      string searches.&nbsp; When searching for Contracts, drop down criteria
      are provided for the products included on the contract.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td valign="top">
      <p align="right" style="margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 4"><FONT color="#008000"><B>Results
      and selection:</B></FONT></td>
    <td valign="top">Select
      the contract you wish to view or edit by clicking on the Contract Number
      in the far left column of the search results.&nbsp; Note that your search
      may have returned more than one page of results and you may need to
      navigate across several pages to find the contract you are looking for.</td>
  </tr>
</table>



</BLOCKQUOTE>